    <innernamespace refid="namespacecanopy__const__mod">canopy_const_mod</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Constants Module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module contains fundamental physical and mathematical constants for air quality and canopy modeling applications. Constants are derived from standard references including the CRC Handbook and atmospheric sciences texts.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Patrick C. Campbell </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>July 2022</para>
</simplesect>
