<listitem><para>CRC76: &quot;CRC Handbook of Chemistry and Physics (76th Ed)&quot;, CRC Press, 1995</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Hobbs, P.V.: &quot;Basic Physical Chemistry for the Atmospheric Sciences&quot;, Cambridge Univ. Press, 206 pp, 1995</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Snyder, J.P.: "Map Projections-A Working Manual, U.S. Geological Survey Paper 1395 U.S.GPO, Washington, DC, 1987</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Stull, R. B.: &quot;An Introduction to Boundary Layer Meteorology&quot;, Kluwer, Dordrecht, 1988 </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
